      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The hamlet was originally called Gin Point, renamed Centreville in 1832 for its midpoint between NYC and Scranton, then Middleville in the late 1850s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
